{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29586","headline":"宿晋昌亭闻惊禽 · 李商隐","name":"宿晋昌亭闻惊禽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羇绪鳏鳏夜景侵，高窗不掩见惊禽。\n飞来曲渚烟方合，过尽南塘树更深。\n胡马嘶和榆塞笛，楚猿吟杂橘村砧。\n失羣挂木知何限，远隔天涯共此心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}